			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"若心"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 221150101,
					"content": "唉，這小常…怎麼還不回來。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221150102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "若心"
				},
				{
					"id": 221150102,
					"content": "小常是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221150103
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 221150103,
					"content": "小常啊，就是你們喊的「常九爺」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221150104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "若心"
				},
				{
					"id": 221150104,
					"content": "唉，我叫他小常叫習慣了，一直就這麼叫了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221150105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "若心"
				},
				{
					"id": 221150105,
					"content": "昨天晚上，他說要出去給自己的小說取材，我也沒在意，就隨口叮囑了他兩句早點回來。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221150106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "若心"
				},
				{
					"id": 221150106,
					"content": "結果，到現在他也沒回來。我真擔心他是出了什麼事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221150107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "若心"
				},
				{
					"id": 221150107,
					"content": "但我這老身子骨，也不好出去找他，能拜託你們，幫我去找找小常嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221150108,
						221150110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "若心"
				},
				{
					"id": 221150108,
					"content": "交給我們吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221150109
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 221150109,
					"content": "那就太好了，就拜託你們了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "若心"
				},
				{
					"id": 221150110,
					"content": "您知道他去哪了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221150111
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 221150111,
					"content": "唉，他還能去哪，還不是北邊的「無妄坡」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221150112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "若心"
				},
				{
					"id": 221150112,
					"content": "請你們幫我去看看他吧，這麼長時間了，可別出了什麼意外。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "若心"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 2211502,
			"completionStepIds": [
				2211504
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
